ired test; pre-existing test deleted, not left intact) while the target command 'cargo test --test grade_spec' is fully green. Confirmed the real case dir at <repo>/newt-eval/cases/012-trait-display-enum/ was never written to (no grade_spec.rs there, workspace/ untouched) -- all work happened under the scratch copy only. Left scratch dir in place per instructions (not cleaned up).) ===
